{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 13,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        51.5808219909668,
        272.9532470703125,
        82.5648193359375
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.95880126953125,
        526.6203002929688,
        180.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "Latent tuberculosis infection (LTBI) is defined as a state of persistent immune response to stimulation by",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.95880126953125,
        526.629150390625,
        194.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "antigens with no evidence of clinically manifest active TB. There is no gold standard  Mycobacterium tuberculosis",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.95880126953125,
        526.7122192382812,
        208.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "test for LTBI. The WHO guidelines on LTBI consider the probability of progression to active TB disease in a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.95880126953125,
        526.6154174804688,
        222.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "specific risk group, the epidemiology and burden of TB, the availability of resources and the likelihood of a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.95880126953125,
        526.6184692382812,
        236.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "broad public health impact. Two fragmented recommendations have been made for the management of LTBI,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.95880126953125,
        526.6603393554688,
        250.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "which resulted in a number of guideline documents, posing a challenge to implementation. Therefore, several",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.95880126953125,
        402.10321044921875,
        264.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "WHO Member States requested consolidated guidelines on LTBI management.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.6287841796875,
        526.6743774414062,
        284.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "The updated, consolidated guidelines in this document respond to that request. They provide a comprehensive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.6287841796875,
        526.7024536132812,
        298.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "set of WHO recommendations for programmatic management of LTBI and the basis and rationale for national",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.6287841796875,
        526.7093505859375,
        312.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines. These guidelines supersede previous WHO policy documents on the management of LTBI in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.6287841796875,
        526.6080932617188,
        326.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "people living with HIV and household contacts of people with TB and other at-risk groups. The guidelines",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.6287841796875,
        526.637451171875,
        340.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "were prepared in accordance with the requirements and recommended process of the WHO Guideline Review",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.6287841796875,
        526.6863403320312,
        354.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "Committee. Seven systematic reviews were conducted to update the recommendations and make new ones.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        355.6287841796875,
        526.6902465820312,
        368.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "The Guideline Development Group considered the quality of the evidence, benefits and harms, values and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.6287841796875,
        526.6630859375,
        382.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "preferences, equity, costs, acceptability and feasibility of implementation in formulating the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.6287841796875,
        202.67713928222656,
        396.42877197265625
      ],
      "text": "and determining their strength.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.2987976074219,
        526.689208984375,
        416.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations are presented logically according to the cascade of care for managing LTBI: identification",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.2987976074219,
        524.4520874023438,
        430.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "of at-risk populations (adults and children living with HIV, HIV-negative adult and child contacts and other HIV-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.2987976074219,
        526.6301879882812,
        444.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "negative at-risk groups), ruling out active TB disease, testing for LTBI, providing treatment, monitoring adverse",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.2987976074219,
        526.6883544921875,
        458.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "events, adherence and completion of treatment and monitoring and evaluation. The recommendations are",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.2987976074219,
        526.6583251953125,
        472.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "categorized as: existing ones previously approved by the review committee and published, which are still valid;",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.2987976074219,
        526.7031860351562,
        486.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "updated recommendations that were previously approved by the review committee but for which the evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.2987976074219,
        526.6652221679688,
        500.0987854003906
      ],
      "text": "was reviewed, discussed with the Guidelines Development Group (GDG) and updated (including for clarity);",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.2987976074219,
        450.13525390625,
        514.0988159179688
      ],
      "text": "and new recommendations. There are 10 existing, 7 updated and 7 new recommendations.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.9688110351562,
        526.693359375,
        533.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "In general, the GDG reviewed the evidence from the systematic reviews and discussed each population risk",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.9688110351562,
        526.6431274414062,
        547.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "group identified in detail for the prevalence of LTBI, the risk for progression to active TB and the incidence of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.9688110351562,
        526.7313232421875,
        561.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "active TB as compared with that in the general population. The GDG used the guiding principle that individual",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.9688110351562,
        526.6741943359375,
        575.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "benefit outweighs risk as the mainstay of recommendations on LTBI testing and treatment. The GDG found",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.9688110351562,
        526.6670532226562,
        589.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "clear evidence for the benefit of systematic testing and treatment of LTBI for people living with HIV and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.9688110351562,
        526.7094116210938,
        603.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "infants and children under 5 years of age who are household contacts of pulmonary TB patients, in all settings,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.9688110351562,
        526.6073608398438,
        617.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "regardless of the background epidemiology of TB. Similarly, they concluded that HIV-negative groups at clinical",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.9688110351562,
        526.7072143554688,
        631.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "risk, such as patients initiating anti-TNF treatment, receiving dialysis, preparing for organ or haematological",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.9688110351562,
        526.662109375,
        645.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "transplantation and those with silicosis would also benefit from testing and treatment of LTBI, regardless of the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.9688110351562,
        474.9611511230469,
        659.768798828125
      ],
      "text": "background TB epidemiology, because of their increased risk of progression to active TB disease.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.6387939453125,
        270.9151306152344,
        679.4387817382812
      ],
      "text": "The specific recommendations are given below.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.5949096679688,
        450.3568420410156,
        711.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "A. Identification of at-risk populations for LTBI testing and treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.3252563476562,
        331.296142578125,
        729.8292236328125
      ],
      "text": "Adults, adolescents, children and infants living with HIV",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        733.1478271484375,
        526.7162475585938,
        745.9478149414062
      ],
      "text": "Adults and adolescents living with HIV, with unknown or a positive tuberculin skin test (TST) and are",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        747.1478271484375,
        526.6373291015625,
        759.9478149414062
      ],
      "text": "unlikely to have active TB should receive preventive treatment of TB as part of a comprehensive package of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        761.1478271484375,
        526.6651611328125,
        773.9478149414062
      ],
      "text": "HIV care. Treatment should be given to these individuals irrespective of the degree of immunosuppression",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        544.2467041015625,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "1",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        450.2544860839844,
        796.524658203125,
        525.9462280273438,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "EXECUTIVE SUMMARY",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}